  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## recv-thehive-event (C4, N8N-1.5)\n**Trigger:** `POST /webhook/thehive-event` from TheHive's webhook (every event of the SOC organisation), token as `Authorization: Bearer` (C4).\n**Inputs:** the TheHive audit event (`operation`, `objectType`, `objectId`, top-level `_createdBy` = the actor, `details`, `object`).\n**Actions taken:** records a summary of every event (operation, object type and id, actor, request id, source, sourceRef), then routes it (first match wins): (1) actor n8n@asox.local (lib-config): ignored, loop prevention; (2) delete: ignored (open question, N8N-1.5); (3) alert update with caseId: promoted; (4) alert update with status; (5) case create; (6) case update with status/stage (closing); (7) Task / Log / Comment: analyst activity; (8) anything else: recorded, no handler. Routes 3-7 end in labelled **no-op stubs** where N8N-5.3 and C11 (N8N-2.9) attach.\n**Systems changed:** none.\n**Approval:** not applicable.\n**Owner:** n8n.\nThe C4 check's test alert is created by n8n's account, so its event ends at (1); the execution is still saved. Error workflow: recv-n8n-error.\nEvents caused by n8n's own account are ignored right after the summary, before lib-config (fast path, N8N-1.4); the execution is still saved.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 620
      },
      "id": "e77fb3fd-3eba-5bd8-b08a-b9d441bd95a6",
