    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// n8n's own writes (alert, observables, comments, tags) come back as C4\n// events: each pb-generic run causes several. Ignored here, before\n// lib-config, so a burst doesn't double the work (N8N-1.4). The account is\n// lib-config thehive.n8n_user; if they ever differ, \"Route\" still ignores\n// these events, only more slowly. The execution is still saved (C4 check).\nconst s = $input.first().json;\nreturn [{ json: { ...s, route: 'loop', status: `ignored: caused by ${s.actor} (loop prevention, fast path)` } }];\n"
      },
